    (at 259.08 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 659d96a5-44d3-4607-9f4c-09388647f977)
  )
  (text "enable interrupts at TP3 when\n* enabled by preceding ION, and\n* not disabled by current IOF, and\n* doing a fetch cycle (started instr after ION)\ndisable interrupts at TP3 when\n* doing an intak cycle, or\n* doing an IOF instruction\nfeeds into brkintfet which is sampled at TP4\n to compute next major state"
    (at 378.46 386.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 669cbaaa-02aa-4603-8766-22f3655352bb)
  )
  (text "compute major state to follow current instruciton\n - if dma triple-cycle, output MS_WRDCT=4\n - if dma single-cycle, output MS_BREAK=6\n - if interrupt, output MS_INTAK=7\n - else, output MS_FETCH=1"
    (at 386.08 127 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 75adee27-db66-46b1-9ba8-b156c711a45a)
  )
  (text "6002 (IOF)" (at 368.3 330.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 84d8c110-8aed-46cc-81de-d4ae1ed2a312)
  )
  (text "3: ADD,TAD,ISZ,DCA,JMS\n2: JMP\n1: IOT\n0: OPR" (at 632.46 139.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8667f4d8-d25f-4b4f-bf55-21f58d961cd4)
  )
  (text "state after FETCH for JMP\n either DEFER or brkintfet"
    (at 495.3 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8bdf66d1-bcd0-4216-b2a6-cc9f48627194)
  )
  (text "LDAD\n pressed:\n  jam EXAM into MAJST\n  gate INBUS to ALUQ\n  then clock ALUQ to MADR,PCTR\n released:\n  release halt request (hreq)\nEXAM\n pressed:\n  jam EXAM into MAJST\n  repeat: gate MADR+1 to ALUQ\n          then clock ALUQ to MADR,PCTR\n released:\n  release halt request (hreq)\nDEPOS same as EXAM plus\n  INBUS put in MBUF during TS2 of DEPOS cycle\nSTART\n pressed:\n  assert BUSINI\n  jam FETCH into MAJST\n released:\n  release halt request (hreq)\nCONT\n pressed:\n  in DEPOS/EXAM:\n   jam FETCH into MAJST\n released:\n  release halt request (hreq)"
    (at 853.44 294.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8eb16fff-711d-4d26-9611-7102155f54bd)
  )
  (text "not being blocked\nby memory extension" (at 382.27 97.79 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 93704b29-b758-4f51-b168-6bf26d5db183)
  )
